{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/34514-where-do-boltholes-come-from","id":34514,"title":"Where do Boltholes come from?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-21T11:04:59-08:00","id":34514,"title":"Where do Boltholes come from?","content":"How are they made?<br /> <br /> Are they leftover infrastructure that was once used for some sorta other purpose? But they have these angel-specific wards...<br /> <br /> ... I have to imagine that some sort of process or embed or exploit is used to make these things. What is it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T19:45:27-08:00","id":34728,"title":"","content":"That's a good question. I have a Tempter in my group who is trying to figure it out, so he can build a massive one. He plans to call it &quot;Hell&quot;.<br /> <br /> I admire his ambitions. If there is an offical answer, I'm going to have to make something up though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T01:04:26-08:00","id":34843,"title":"","content":"Everyone knows those little out-of-the-way places from their childhood away from the prying eyes of adults. The hollowed-out log in the forest just big enough to store a diary, the storm drain that goes under the roadway, the hallway between the basements of the high-rise buildings that people always thought was boarded-up. Demons who have Boltholes have created or found connections from this world to parts of the God-Machine where it lacks sensors, to pockets created by the strange angles of space-time, or places even stranger. Perhaps they are solidified Intent, formed by the vestiges of the Angel's Fall (if the player starts with it), or Cover Infrastructure unable to be fully &quot;digested&quot; back into the God-Machine upon the Angel's Fall. Perhaps they are a by-product of an Occult Matrix, unobserved, unintended, and unnoticed by the God-Machine. Just some thoughts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T01:05:10-08:00","id":34844,"title":"","content":"As for an Exploit, I would prefer to have it be the result of in-game Plot rather than a roll of the dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T02:34:55-08:00","id":34865,"title":"","content":"I can see arguments made for &quot;funny little snags in the fabric of reality&quot; and &quot;leftovers of imperfectly demolished Infrastructure.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paddon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/34514-where-do-boltholes-come-from?p=34844#post34844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for an Exploit, I would prefer to have it be the result of in-game Plot rather than a roll of the dice.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have to agree! However, making temporary Boltholes would be an excellent Exploit or Interlock.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T15:29:36-08:00","id":35166,"title":"","content":"I can't see them being ENTIRELY accidental, because again, they seem so purpose-built... but perhaps some midway can be proposed here.<br /> <br /> My players are interested in creating a Bolthole ICly which is why this topic comes up. I'm inclined to make it a retrofitted bit of Infrastructure - so, they'd come in, set up shop, and start trying to build it up to a right and proper bolthole.<br /> <br /> I'm debating whether I want this to be something they can just do innately, with elbow-grease... or whether I want them to have to solicit the help of older Unchained, or even an Agency. I'm trying to figure out the most fun, interesting way I can get them a bolthole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T17:40:17-08:00","id":35220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/34514-where-do-boltholes-come-from?p=35166#post35166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't see them being ENTIRELY accidental, because again, they seem so purpose-built... but perhaps some midway can be proposed here. My players are interested in creating a Bolthole ICly which is why this topic comes up. I'm inclined to make it a retrofitted bit of Infrastructure - so, they'd come in, set up shop, and start trying to build it up to a right and proper bolthole. I'm debating whether I want this to be something they can just do innately, with elbow-grease... or whether I want them to have to solicit the help of older Unchained, or even an Agency. I'm trying to figure out the most fun, interesting way I can get them a bolthole.</div> </div> </div> </div> Well since mechanically it's just a merit you can buy with no special prerequisites, I'd say its something that could be done just with elbow grease. With the slight caveat that it's the special kind of grease specifically for the elbows of angels an demons. Probably a different application of the same kind of infrastructure that hides the gears of the God-Machine. A base of concealment, a dash of defense, and a generous helping of spatial folding. All stuff a Demon with the know how and enough access to the right kind of infrastructure could accomplish without too much difficulty. I'd treat it similarly to mortals building a Safe Place from the ground up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T07:38:09-08:00","id":35565,"title":"","content":"My take is that Boltholes are essentially custom Infrastructure. They're very <i>simple</i> by God-Machine standards, so most demons can either make them or know someone who can.<br /> <br /> You could make constructing them into an Exploit, but it seems a little too indirect to create and purchase an Exploit your character is planning on using just once or twice. I think Charlaquin's got the right idea with comparing it to making a Safe Place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T07:07:31-08:00","id":39953,"title":"","content":"It's mentioned that low cover identities can have strange things similar to boltholes, like an apartment on the fifth floor of a building with four floors. Boltholes could be this kind of thing, a glitch in cover that is modified or just used as is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/92-ramza","name":"Ramza","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar92_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T21:18:28-08:00","id":41503,"title":"","content":"When one grownup boltholt loves another grownup bolthole very, very much, they want to show that. They both take their clothes off and get into bed where they have spider-man wrestling competitions. 9 months later a Psychopomp demon flys over and delivers a baby bolthole to the loving grownup boltholes..... sorry, couldn't stop myself, I think I have issues.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T15:19:01-08:00","id":55734,"title":"","content":"Right within the description for Bolthole: &quot;Your character has a safehouse she can hole up in when things get bad. The bolthole is part of the Infrastructure that maintains your character\u2019s Cover (though the demon can access it no matter what Cover she wears), which means it doesn\u2019t exist entirely in the physical world.&quot;<br /> <br /> My only educated guess, then, is that it is a &quot;necessary component for fulfilling your purpose&quot; leftover, or, simply a change you made to the basic infrastructure that houses your cover's protections, like you changing your everything else-ness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2074,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2074-64bitjedi","user":"64bitjedi","date":".  Misread. 01-22-2014, 06:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2074-64bitjedi","name":"64bitjedi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T05:07:30-08:00","id":80969,"title":"","content":"Ok, so Demons can get their Boltholes with elbow grease. But do they know that Boltholes are even a thing? Is it a part of the initial set of retained G-M knowledge along with their Cover and the 3/4 initial Embeds or do they have to learn/discover somehow that Boltholes are even an option for them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2108-genesis","name":"genesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}